Third-party work this repository builds on
------------------------------------------

helius-labs/privacy-ring-examples (Helius Labs)
  https://github.com/helius-labs/privacy-ring-examples
  Pinned commit 9e5d69ade7e0c107a2929306d3b758a8969e1089.
  scripts/setup.sh clones it into .tools/ (not part of this repository) and
  builds its swap program, which the swap side of Keeler runs. The lend tests
  include its test-utils/mollusk.rs, test-utils/utxo.rs and
  test-utils/wallet.rs from that checkout with #[path]; they are not copied
  here. These files in this repository contain code from it:
    lend/sdk/src/proof.rs      in part, from swap/xark/sdk/src/proof.rs
    lend/sdk/src/lib.rs        Authority::complete_inputs, from
                               swap/xark/sdk/src/shared.rs; prove_transact_with
                               follows prove_transact there
    lend/spike/tests/spike.rs  the same function
    cli/src/chain.rs           prove_spp, from prove_transact in
                               swap/xark/sdk/src/shared.rs
    patches/swap.patch         a patch to swap/xark (program features, lock),
                               with lines of that repository as context
  That repository carries no licence at the pinned commit. Those files, as
  far as they come from it, remain Helius Labs' and are not covered by this
  repository's Apache-2.0 licence.

